{"overview":"سوزو، دانش‌آموز ۱۷ سالهٔ دبیرستانی که در شهر روستایی‌ای با پدرش زندگی می‌کند، از دست دادن مادرش در کودکی زخمی شده است. یک روز، دنیای آنلاین عظیم «U» را کشف می‌کند و به‌عنوان آواتار خود، بل، وارد این واقعیت جایگزین می‌شود. به‌زودی تمام نگاه‌های «U» به بل معطوف می‌شود، وقتی که ناگهان موجودی مرموز شبیه به اژدها پیش‌رویش ظاهر می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Suzu is a 17-year-old high-school student living in a rural town with her father. Wounded by the loss of her mother at a young age, Suzu one day discovers the massive online world \"U\" and dives into this alternate reality as her avatar, Belle. Before long, all of U's eyes are fixed on Belle, when, suddenly, a mysterious, dragon-like figure appears before her.","tagline_en":"You are no longer alone.","runtime":121,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["細田守"],"crew_en":["Mamoru Hosoda"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"中村佳穂","role":"Suzu Naito / Belle (voice)","photo":"/kW0WsXcYUdGjxgVN7YsJgg1Rltp.jpg","en":"Kaho Nakamura"},{"name":"成田凌","role":"Shinobu Hisatake (voice)","photo":"/nuDFEGyuL4b1u5JUNee7WmJfgp3.jpg","en":"Ryo Narita"},{"name":"شوتا سومتانی","role":"Shinjiro 'Kamishin' Chikami (voice)","photo":"/sEEfyEfEbd9TQB9gFlvDTQJov76.jpg","en":"Shota Sometani"},{"name":"玉城ティナ","role":"Ruka Watanabe (voice)","photo":"/u2OfpoFq4ZFaWnuCuH0JSpTo6hr.jpg","en":"Tina Tamashiro"},{"name":"幾田りら","role":"Hiroka 'Hiro' Betsuyaku (voice)","photo":"/qIH0Sb2H4jae2ywBo1VTSMrL4zD.jpg","en":"Lilas Ikuta"},{"name":"森山良子","role":"Yoshitani (voice)","photo":"/47JOgZqEEt0vJjbnXXvPBljPKAp.jpg","en":"Ryoko Moriyama"},{"name":"清水ミチコ","role":"Kita (voice)","photo":"/uUweeAQD3URr1XLKfS4hjoVXWAT.jpg","en":"Michiko Shimizu"},{"name":"坂本冬美","role":"Okumoto (voice)","photo":"/ojm4FbTapWtbOH59KVjGu11ShZ5.jpg","en":"Fuyumi Sakamoto"},{"name":"岩崎良美","role":"Nakai (voice)","photo":"/3GPmPaNWw2Q0hAIjceMGCJ1dDLy.jpg","en":"Yoshimi Iwasaki"},{"name":"Sachiyo Nakao","role":"Hatanaka (voice)","photo":"/mrXEbnVdtho